1
00:00:00,181 --> 00:00:02,251
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, don't
listen to him.

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:03,920
(Leonard:)We're actually
physicists.

3
00:00:03,919 --> 00:00:05,919
(Leonard:)We're giving a lecture
at Berkeley later today.

4
00:00:05,921 --> 00:00:07,921
(Leonard:)We just... we had
some time to kill.

5
00:00:07,923 --> 00:00:10,093
GUARD: Hey, listen, you
seem like decent guys.

6
00:00:10,092 --> 00:00:11,422
(Security Guard:)I can't let you in,

7
00:00:11,426 --> 00:00:13,956
(Security Guard:)but I got some hats and T-shirts
I can give you.

8
00:00:13,962 --> 00:00:15,792
(Leonard:)Thank you so much.

9
00:00:15,797 --> 00:00:17,467
(Leonard:)See?

10
00:00:17,466 --> 00:00:18,696
(Leonard:)Maybe honesty is the best...
(door opens)

11
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,700
(Leonard:)What are you doing?

12
00:00:19,701 --> 00:00:21,371
(Sheldon:)Shedding the yoke
of my oppressors,

13
00:00:21,369 --> 00:00:23,439
(Sheldon:)you blind,
sad little man.

14
00:00:24,371 --> 00:00:25,701
Don't move!

15
00:00:25,707 --> 00:00:27,807
(Security Guard:)Code A-A-23, A-A-23.

16
00:00:27,809 --> 00:00:29,139
GUARD 2:
Copy.

17
00:00:29,144 --> 00:00:31,144
SHELDON (gasps):
I can see the ranch, Leonard!

18
00:00:31,146 --> 00:00:33,816
(Sheldon:)Oh, it's rustic,
it's lovely.

19
00:00:33,815 --> 00:00:36,545
(Sheldon:)I'd take a picture,
but people are chasing me.

20
00:00:38,152 --> 00:00:39,482
I'm gonna make it...!

21
00:00:39,488 --> 00:00:40,818
I'm gonna make it!

22
00:00:40,822 --> 00:00:43,152
(Sheldon:)They have Tasers,
but they wouldn't dare use...

23
00:00:43,158 --> 00:00:44,488
(Sheldon screams)

24
00:00:44,493 --> 00:00:45,963
(thuds)

25
00:00:47,228 --> 00:00:49,768
(Howard:)Come on, Raj.

26
00:00:49,765 --> 00:00:53,435
(Howard:)You are the King Kong
of Ping-Pong.

27
00:00:53,435 --> 00:00:57,105
(Howard:)You are the menace
of table tennis.

